              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basebemngcwaba; wonke u-Israyeli wamlilela njengezwi likaJehova alikhuluma ngesandla senceku yakhe u-Ahiya umprofethi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
