              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezinye izindaba zikaJerobowamu, ukuthi walwa kanjani nokuthi wabusa kanjani, bheka, kulotshiwe encwadini yezindaba zemihla ngemihla yamakhosi akwa-Israyeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
