          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "URehobowamu indodana kaSolomoni wabusa kwaJuda. URehobowamu wayeneminyaka engamashumi amane nanye ekuqaleni kwakhe ukubusa, wabusa iminyaka eyishumi nesikhombisa eJerusalema, umuzi uJehova awukhethile ezizweni zonke zakwa-Israyeli ukuba amise khona igama lakhe. Igama likanina lalinguNahama wakwa-Amoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.21"
            ]
          }
        }
