              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bazakhela nabo izindawo eziphakemeyo, nezithombe, neziqu zemithi phezu kwawo wonke amagquma aphakeme naphansi kwayo yonke imithi eluhlaza.",
