              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi uRehobowamu yenza izihlangu zethusi esikhundleni sazo, yazinikela esandleni senduna yemilindankosi, umlindi womnyango wendlu yenkosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
