        {
          "text": "URehobowamu wayeselala koyise, wembelwa koyise emzini kaDavide. Igama likanina lalinguNahama nabantwana bakwa-Amoni. U-Abhiya indodana yakhe waba yinkosi esikhundleni sakhe.",
